14. Development Outcome
At the end of this phase, the project should have a functional FitBuddy-AI MVP in which a user can:

Register → Enter fitness details → Generate a Gemini-powered plan → View workouts → Complete workouts → Track progress.

The next phase after development is the testing phase, where the application, database, APIs, Gemini responses, UI, security, and overall fitness-plan workflow are systematically tested.


